Estañion is a scholar of [[Geography/Lorandris/index|Lorandris]], renowned enough that the [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Metropolitan Conservatory|MetCon]] names him on the plaque of the painting *Fūlwinter Falls*. Lorandris has many people who go by a single name: when the country that once stood there, Fūlwinter, was destroyed, its nobility and their family names were lost with it, and its people stopped using surnames.
